<div style="text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 16px;">
        Welcome to {{#if programCategory.name}}{{programCategory.name}}{{else}}YBB Platform{{/if}}!
    </h2>
    
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Hi {{name}},
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 500px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        We are thrilled to welcome you to our community. You have taken the first step towards accessing exclusive international programs, impactful events, and a network of changemakers.
    </p>

    <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 32px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #374151;">Here is what you can do now:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #4b5563;">
            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Update your profile to stand out to organizers.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Browse open programs and funding opportunities.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0;">Connect with fellow delegates and mentors.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="cta-button">
        Go to Dashboard
    </a>

    <p style="margin-top: 32px; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5;">
        Ready to make an impact? We can't wait to see what you achieve with us.
    </p>
</div>
